WEBVTT

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:20.690
Things are moving so fast.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.360
The moments ticking by.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.190
I'm running through this city.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.030
To me, a savanna.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:27.360
Like it's struggling...

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.370
... trying to break free...

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:32.700
... I wanna test all this power!

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.370
I know that "The Answer"...

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:36.710
... is out there someplace.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:40.040
The answer that everyone looks for...

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.550
... from the day they're born.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.210
When all looks lost...

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.720
... and there's no escape...

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
... I turn to my dreams!

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:53.220
I'm not afraid of getting hurt...

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:56.560
... but I'm not strong, either.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:00.060
It's just that I can't stand...

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:03.500
... just doing nothing anymore!

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.000
Here we go, go! I'll just run on...

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.670
... and let nobody stop me now!

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.840
I wanna find the me in the future...

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:19.010
... and give her a reason for life!

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.130
The Claire Bible.

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:36.470
Supposedly the remaining knowledge
of the Water Dragon King...

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:39.540
... after he exhausted all his strength in the
battle with the Dark Lord 1000 years ago.

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.540
A revelation about the netherworld.

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:43.370
Those who have been touched
by this knowledge...

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:45.710
... wrote it down in various forms.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:48.540
These different versions are all known
as Claire Bible manuscripts.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:50.550
Xellos... Who are you?

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:53.220
What is your connection
to the manuscript?

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:57.390
And who is this mysterious figure
who appeared in Atlas City...

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:59.220
... during the uproar
with the magic beasts?

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:06.460
"An Ancient Pledge!
One Who Seeks Immortality!"

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.500
Just a little longer.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:18.340
Just a little longer
and I'll have you back.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:23.340
We've come this far.
Just wait a little longer.

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:27.680
I really don't know anything
about those magic beasts!

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.180
Tarimu! It's all Tarimu's doing!

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:35.860
I don't know anything! It's Demia!

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:37.360
It's all Demia's doing!

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.200
You still say that after you summoned
those gloopy magic beasts?!

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.530
What are you talking about?!
You liar! Liar! Liar!

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:43.360
How dare you, you doddering old fool!

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:52.370
Damn you! You liar!

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.210
How dare you!

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.700
Why, you!

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:01.150
- How dare you!
- What did I do?!

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:03.820
I thought we could find out
from those two...

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.820
...what really caused that incident
with the magic beasts...

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:09.660
...but it looks like I was wrong.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:15.160
But at the very least we know
those two didn't summon them.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:19.340
A summoning spell usually
requires high level magic.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:24.170
Yeah... So if it wasn't those two,
then who- ?

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.160
Flare Arrow!

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.350
Whoa, Lina! C'mon, control yourself!

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.180
Lemme go!

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:40.190
So, you really have no idea who summoned
those magic beasts or why?

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.180
None.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.860
So, you're telling me that you two...

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:49.030
...who tried to kill each other
before even being attacked...

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:51.370
...and also dragged some sorcerers
just passing through into this...

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:55.700
...have nothing to do with
summoning those magic beasts?

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:57.870
- Exactly.
- Exactly.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.210
Uh, look...

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:03.980
For one thing, I don't, don't,
don't know how to summon them!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:08.310
Me, neither. The only one I know who
could summon magic beasts is-

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:10.990
Wh- What?

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:14.660
I know someone who knows
how to do summonings!

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.660
And he hates us, to boot!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:19.160
It's him! It's him!
The former Guild director!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:20.660
Halcyform!

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.500
The former director
of the Sorcerers Guild...

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:28.840
This all must be a plot
to set the two of us up!

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.860
And just where are you going, Halcyform?

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:55.870
Just out. To do an unpleasant thing.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:05:00.360
Besides, there's still
something I need to get.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:08.640
The former Guild director?

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:13.650
He's a man who was banished from both
the Sorcerers' Guild and from the city!

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:18.150
He'd have no trouble casting
a summoning spell!

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:23.160
Over the last few years,
he became an arrogant tyrant.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:24.830
Not just arrogant.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:28.660
He was involved in an
unsavory branch of research.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.670
"Unsavory branch of research?"

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:32.670
Immortality research.

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:33.500
Immortality...

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.490
...research?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:39.330
Branch? You mean like
on trees and bamboo?

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:42.010
Not that kind of branch, you idiot!

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:43.180
He studied how not to die!

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:45.350
Eternal life! Understand?!

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.680
I see...

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:51.520
It's been a taboo research subject
among sorcerers for a long time.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:54.190
A king obsessed with
finding immortality...

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:55.690
...once offered a huge reward
for it and ended up...

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:58.190
...throwing his kingdom into chaos,
ultimately destroying it.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:05:59.860
Other kingdoms throughout
the land trying to find it...

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:02.460
...were left covered with
piles of dead bodies.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.970
That research has a long
and bloody history.

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:06.970
Covered with dead bodies?

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:10.810
In short, the fastest way of testing...

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:13.640
...whether your research
subject was immortal...

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:18.310
...was to kill him, and if he didn't die,
you were successful.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:21.150
Of course, there's no record
of any successes.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.990
Yes. And rumors began
to spread that he was...

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:29.830
...using human test subjects
in his immortality experiments.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:32.660
Human subjects?!
Halcyfrom was...

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:36.670
They were just rumors, but at the time
Halcyform was Guild Director...

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:40.500
...there were a series of
disappearances around town.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.510
Yeah! Ten, twenty,
maybe thirty people.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:48.340
That's why we convinced the Guild
to revoke his directorship...

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:50.850
...and banish him before
things got out of hand!

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:53.520
I'm afraid he didn't
take it very well.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:57.690
So, he'd set the two men responsible
for his banishment against each other...

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:59.190
And, if that didn't work,

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:02.290
summoned those magic beasts
to have them finish you in one stroke.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.460
At the very least,
despite your obsession...

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:07.630
...with getting the Guild
directorship...

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:10.970
...I can't say I approve
of this meddling.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:14.800
I see. It all connects,
neatly and tidily.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.640
It may all connect,
but what do we do now?

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.470
This despicable man is guilty
of countless misdeeds!

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:28.150
Everything clearly shows we must go
and kill this evil sorcerer!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:30.320
Justice awaits you, fiend!

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.480
Now, let us go to the place of battle!

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:37.830
Hey, mister! Dinner set for five, please!

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:40.490
And charge it to the girl on the pole!

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.670
Miss Lina, won't you stop being you?

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:54.010
No way! As long as the royal house
of Seyruun has influence...

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:56.350
...I say we use it
as much as we can!

00:07:56.350 --> 00:08:00.350
Oh, Daddy's gonna kill me...

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:03.950
Besides, we should consider our next step.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.290
Please, give it back to me!

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:09.460
A sorcerer behind the scenes
doing immortality research...

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:13.300
Yeah. I thought things were bad since
those magic beasts appeared...

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.960
...but it looks like the real
trouble is coming soon.

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:17.130
In this case...

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:18.300
What should we do?

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:20.800
Maybe I should stay out of this.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:21.970
What?!

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:25.470
Well, I don't want to
meet some sorcerer...

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:28.980
...who uses human subjects
in immortality experiments!

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.810
Besides, there were those magic beasts...

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:37.150
That little incident has given me
a bad feeling about all of this.

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:39.990
But, if we do that,
we can say goodbye...

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.830
...to getting our hard-earned money.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.830
Huh?! That's right!

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.830
We'd have killed all those
magic beasts for free.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:48.830
Free?

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:52.840
That's right. Mr. Tarimu
and Mr. Demia are in prison.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:53.670
For free?!

00:08:55.670 --> 00:09:00.340
We can't let that happen! We have
to get paid for our work somehow!

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:04.280
Free work... The businessman's blood
that flows inside of me...

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:06.450
...can't forgive anything like that!

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:08.950
You say that, but still eat
on another person's credit!

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:12.120
We're gonna settle this right now!

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:13.620
Rope! Rope!

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:18.130
In that case, we'd better go
after the puppet master.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:19.800
I agree.

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:22.460
We'll be facing a sorcerer who
can summon magic beasts.

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:24.130
Don't let your guard down.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:24.970
Right.

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:26.470
Now that we've settled that...

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:27.300
Mister!

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:30.290
Let's have the special
hors d'oeuvres for five over here!

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:36.980
We're finished questioning
you for today!

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:39.810
And don't even think of using any funny
magic- business to escape!

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:43.820
For heaven's sake...

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:46.480
How could this day get any worse?

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.500
Now what?

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.330
Are they giving us our dinner?

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:17.190
Halcyform's confiscated mansion.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:19.190
It's a good place to start looking.

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.520
Really? Why here?

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.860
Because, even though it was in
the middle of the magic beast invasion...

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:26.200
...it's the only place that
doesn't have a scratch on it.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.530
Let's be honest here.
That just isn't natural, is it?

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:31.020
This may just be my intuition
talking here, but...

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:36.870
No, I'd say it's on the money.

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:40.880
Don't hide in there! Come out!

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:42.370
Why, you!

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:46.210
That bastard...

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:00.830
Tarimu and Demia! What you two...

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:05.490
This is my punishment to men who don't know
their place and dared to have me banished!

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.660
Fireball!

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:17.350
Well done. I can see the ones...

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:20.180
...who could interfere
with me have great skill.

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:23.350
It's him! It's him!
It's Halcyform!

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:45.040
How do you do?

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:51.380
I know very well the faces of you
who interfered with my plans.

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:54.380
I see.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:58.550
So those creepy things
were your revenge.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.150
Hold it right there!

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:11.170
Miss Lina, this man may be an imposter!

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:13.170
Everyone knows that villains...

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:16.170
...who defy heaven's will
and disturb the world's order...

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.330
...always dress in black!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.010
Owww!

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.680
Sorry about that. Please go on.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.350
Actually, I really don't have
anything more to say.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:35.520
Can I assume you all will
continue to oppose me?

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:39.030
Well, we are sorta
gonna keep on doing this.

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:42.030
If we don't get rid of you,
we'll never get paid.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:45.700
In that case, I need only to
make all of you disappear.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:52.710
However, I find the magic of your bodies
appealing for my uses.

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:54.040
B- Body?!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:58.210
Gourry, you're into that, right?!
Go with him!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.210
Who's into what?!

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:02.820
I will make you subjects
in my experiments.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:06.490
I shall extract your life energy.

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:08.320
Our life energy?!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:14.000
I had thought that Tarimu and Demia
wouldn't provide enough for me...

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.000
You're using people
in your experiments?!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.830
Yes. Now be good
enough to die quietly.

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:21.000
I'm quite busy and have
no time to waste.

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:24.330
Fireball!

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:30.330
Flare Arrow!

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.690
Oh, a tough guy, huh?

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:41.360
Elmekia Lance!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:44.020
Gaav... Flare!

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:51.700
Hey, Zel! It's sorta extreme
to throw Gaav Flares around!

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:57.870
I'm so pleased by
the power of your magic.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.030
What?!

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:04.150
Hmpf! I was expecting you to be powerful
considering you can summon magic beasts.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.150
Oh, haven't you figured that out yet?

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:09.650
I wasn't the one who
summoned those beasts.

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:13.640
Unfortunately, I can't cast summoning spells.

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:21.000
Allow me to introduce the one who
summoned the beasts for me.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.330
Saygram. My dear partner
in this project.

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.840
Saygram...

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.170
Flare Lance!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:31.510
No fair, calling in reinforcements!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:34.000
I'll show you the burning
rage of Justice!

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:39.010
Looks like my bad feeling
was right on target.

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:42.350
The only ones who can summon
magic beasts are skilled sorcerers...

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:43.520
...or Monsters.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.690
What? He's a Monster?!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:47.690
Why didn't you say so?!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:50.360
Because you didn't give me
a chance to do it!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.860
Anyway... This isn't what I was expecting.

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:54.860
I'm outta here.

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:58.030
Hey! Hey, Lina!

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:59.030
Come on!

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:00.470
That payment isn't worth fighting...

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:03.810
...some powerful sorcerer and a Monster!

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:06.480
A powerful sorcerer and a Monster?

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:10.480
A powerful sorcerer doing
immortality research and a Monster...

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:14.650
Put them together and...
Did he make the Pledge?!

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:15.820
Are you saying?!

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:19.650
Oh, you know about the Pledge?

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:20.990
Great, he did do it...

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:22.660
What pledge?

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:25.650
The Pledge of Immortality
with the Monster race!

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:29.000
Huh? What? What?

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.830
Looks like you don't
all know about it.

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:33.000
Now be nice and let me
capture you.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:36.460
After all, soon you'll be
feeling no pain at all.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.510
For now...

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:40.670
Run for it!

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:43.850
H- Hey!

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:44.680
C'mon, move it!

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:56.190
Okay, what's going on here?

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:59.690
Halcyform's made a pledge
with the Monster race.

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:00.630
A pledge?

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:02.630
The Pledge of Immortality
with the Monsters...

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:04.470
...to give him temporary immortality.

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:05.970
And that's the thing with
the bamboo branch, right?

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.970
No, forget that!
He's immortal!

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:10.310
He wouldn't die even
if we killed him!

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:11.470
What?!

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:14.140
Couldn't you have figured out
something that important...

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:15.810
...from the information
you had or the situation?

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:16.810
How could I?

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:20.480
First of all, you were with me the whole
time and you didn't know it, either!

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:23.490
Wrong! I could tell
just by looking at him!

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:25.490
Oh, that's right.
The only words missing...

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:29.820
...in your dictionary are "memory"
and "understanding".

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:42.670
We can't just hide here,
Mr. Zelgadis!

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:45.510
We have to finish them off
in one blow right here!

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:47.510
And how will we fight them?

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:49.680
With courage and a righteous heart!

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:50.850
How about in reality?

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:54.180
A heart that loves Justice
shall burn like fire!

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:55.680
Helping us how, exactly?

00:16:55.680 --> 00:17:00.360
The fire of Justice in your heart
will burn villains to death, naturally!

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:02.290
Now, look!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.130
Miss Lina!

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:06.620
Mosu Varium!

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.130
Not bad at all.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:16.810
Your magical powers
truly please me.

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:21.640
But I'm a busy man, and don't
have time for these games.

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:25.480
So, you expect us to say
"Sure" and be your test subjects?!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.820
Elmekia Lance!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.990
Flare Bit!

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.650
Damus Bras!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:55.010
Darn it! You really
can't kill this guy!

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:56.680
Can't we do anything?!

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:58.340
I don't know.

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:01.620
I may have something, but...

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:04.120
What?! Hurry up and do it!

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:06.620
Canceling the Pledge
takes a lot of work!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.610
It's really hard!

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:11.290
Fireball!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:29.310
Glass... It just might work...

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:31.650
All right, what have I got to lose?

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:35.320
Halcyform! I accept the honor
of being your victim!

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:36.650
Lina!

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:39.650
Made up your mind, eh?

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:43.320
"Holy wind..."

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:48.330
" Wind which gently flows
across the land..."

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:54.330
"Let all things be filled
with your pure breath!"

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:57.500
Van Rail!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.940
This will not...

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.620
You did it, Lina!

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:16.610
It actually worked...

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.630
But he isn't dead yet!

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:24.300
We've just bought
ourselves sometime.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.470
- Now's our chance!
- To run?

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.300
No! Before we could
get out of town...

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:31.640
...he'd break out of that ice
and come after us!

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:34.310
That's a reasonable conclusion.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:35.300
Xellos!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:37.810
You!

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:40.480
You dare show your face
in front of me again?!

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:43.320
Yeah! Where'd you disappear to
and why'd you come back?!

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:46.980
Please! You make me sound like
some sort of unwanted insect.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:53.830
In any case...

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:57.830
The truth is I thought I'd come
and tell you something interesting.

00:19:57.830 --> 00:19:59.330
Oh? Something interesting, huh?

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:02.500
To kill one who has made the Pledge
of Immortality with the Monster race...

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:04.670
...you need to destroy
the Pledge Stone!

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:07.510
One way is to kill the Monster
he made the Pledge with.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.340
Another possibility would be
to call upon the power...

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:11.180
...of a high-level Monster
like Shabranigdo...

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:14.680
...and use a Dragon Slave,
which might kill Halcyform.

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:17.690
But if I used that here,
I'd blow away half the city.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.850
Oh, so you do know.
I should have guessed...

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:23.690
...a maniac for knowing all
the sorcerer's secrets like you...

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:25.530
...would know about it.

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:29.530
Oh, I know a few things,
but not why you're so...

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:33.200
...hot to find the Claire Bible,
or why Saygram's afraid of you-

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:37.540
Um, could we save that?
That really isn't important now.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:40.370
Mr. Halcyform's ice
is beginning to melt.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:45.050
First, don't you think you should
find the Pledge Stone?

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.880
All right, all right!

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:49.370
Don't run away till this is over!

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.390
The Pledge Stone...

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:55.060
It has to be somewhere
in this mansion.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:57.220
We have to find it,
no matter what!

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:18.680
Something's taken control now.

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:23.520
Your life's hopes and dreams are gone.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:27.010
Are you satisfied with your life now?

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:33.030
Got that fin de siecle feeling...

00:21:33.030 --> 00:21:37.360
... and spend every day preparing.

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:40.530
So let's get your engine running!

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:42.870
Throw off all of...

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:46.530
... that rusty common sense!

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:51.550
You want to be the talk of the world!

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:55.050
You want to have a shining future!

00:21:55.050 --> 00:21:57.380
That and this are your true dreams.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:01.150
Don't let anyone get in your way!

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:06.160
To be the talk of the world...

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:09.830
... let the greatness inside burst out!

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:12.170
You only get one break in life...

00:22:12.170 --> 00:22:13.830
... so let's say bye- bye...

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:15.170
... to your timid self!

00:22:15.170 --> 00:22:17.660
It's all right!

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:24.680
Damnit! So you have an immortaI body!
That's so unfair!

00:22:24.680 --> 00:22:28.680
Eh? You want me to join you?
What should I do?

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:32.020
Next Episode is: " Staying Behind
for the Sake of Love!"

00:22:32.020 --> 00:22:34.680
If you don't watch,
I'll go berserk!
